🌸 1. Alluring
Very attractive and tempting.
Tamil: கவர்ச்சியான
Synonyms: Attractive, Captivating, Enchanting
🧠 Allure = attract
✨ 2. Enchanting
So charming that it feels magical.
Tamil: மயக்கும் / வசீகரிக்கும்
Synonyms: Charming, Captivating, Bewitching
🧠 Enchantment = magic
💫 3. Captivating
Holding your attention because something is extremely interesting or beautiful.
Tamil: மனதை கவரும்
Synonyms: Fascinating, Mesmerizing, Alluring
🧠 Capture → Captivating = captures your attention
😍 4. Mesmerizing
Extremely fascinating or beautiful.
Tamil: மயக்கும்
Synonyms: Hypnotic, Captivating, Spellbinding
🧠 Mesmerize = make someone unable to look away
👑 5. Exquisite
Extremely beautiful, delicate, or high-quality.
Tamil: மிக அழகான / நேர்த்தியான
Synonyms: Elegant, Refined, Beautiful
🧠 Exquisite = extremely beautiful
🌟 6. Ravishing
Extremely beautiful or attractive.
Tamil: பேரழகான
Synonyms: Gorgeous, Stunning, Beautiful
🧠 Ravish = overwhelm with beauty
💎 7. Resplendent
Very impressive, bright, and magnificent.
Tamil: பிரகாசமான / சிறப்புமிக்க
Synonyms: Magnificent, Splendid, Glorious
🧠 Resplendent → Re + splendid
🌙 8. Ethereal
Extremely delicate, light, and almost heavenly.
Tamil: தெய்வீகமான / மிக மென்மையான
Synonyms: Heavenly, Delicate, Celestial
🧠 Ethereal = looks too beautiful to be earthly
🔥 9. Striking
Very noticeable and impressive.
Tamil: மிகவும் கவர்ச்சியான / கண்கவர்
Synonyms: Impressive, Eye-catching, Remarkable
🧠 Strikes your eyes → Striking
🌹 10. Pulchritudinous
Very beautiful, especially in appearance.
Tamil: மிகுந்த அழகுடைய
Synonyms: Beautiful, Attractive, Lovely
🧠 Pulchritudinous = beauty, but the word itself looks complicated! 😄
